              "{\"articleSection\":[\"business\"],\"author\":[{\"name\":\"Daniel Shane\"}],\"dateModified\":\"2019-04-01T08:21:22Z\",\"headline\":\"China’s factories are now defying the economic slowdown\",\"alternativeHeadline\":\"China March PMI: Factories are now defying the economic slowdown\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"publisher\":{\"name\":\"CNN\",\"foundingDate\":\"1980-06-01\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/cnn/\",\"https://x.com/CNN\",\"https://www.tiktok.com/@cnn\",\"https://www.instagram.com/cnn/\",\"https://www.youtube.com/cnn\"]},\"timeRequired\":\"P0Y0M0DT0H2M6S\",\"wordCount\":474,\"video\":[{\"dateModified\":\"2019-01-21T15:00:08Z\",\"uploadDate\":\"2019-01-21T14:27:40Z\",\"duration\":\"PT00H02M20S\",\"caption\":[{\"encodingFormat\":\"vtt\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"},{\"encodingFormat\":\"srt\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}],\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"name\":\"China reports slowest economic growth since 1990\",\"headline\":\"China reports slowest economic growth since 1990\",\"description\":\"China's GDP for 2018 was announced at 6.6% - the weakest annual growth from the world's second largest economy in almost three decades. China has started coming under pressure from the trade war with the United States, which has resulted in new tariffs on more than $250 billion of Chinese exports. CNN's Will Ripley reports.\"}],\"datePublished\":\"2019-04-01T03:53:12Z\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":false,\"hasPart\":{\"isAccessibleForFree\":false}}"
